OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain and showers
OL,6,Fduring the morning. In the far
OL,7,Fsouthwest, some spells of autumn
OL,8,Fsunshine will break through and
OL,9,Fshowers will keep to coasts, though
OL,10,Fthese may be heavy. Feeling chilly,
OL,11,Fespecially under the cloud further
OL,12,Finland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FSome showers lingering along
OL,15,Fcoastlines, but generally dry.
OL,16,FTemperatures will fall to become a
OL,17,Fcold night, under increasingly clear
OL,18,Fspells. Areas of fog and patches of
OL,19,Ffrost to develop later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
