OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny areas of fog will lift
OL,6,Fthrough the morning. From then, a dry
OL,7,Fbut mostly cloudy day is expected,
OL,8,Fwith the occasional break to sunny
OL,9,Fskies. Another chilly autumn day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFoggy
OL,12,Fin places on Sunday morning which will
OL,13,Flift to leave a sunny autumn day.
OL,14,FBecoming increasingly cloudy on Monday
OL,15,Fahead of evening rain. Milder, wetter
OL,16,Fand windier on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
